The machines is a list of 1, 0, and 5.
The last is the last position of machines.
The count is last plus 1.
The total is 0.
For each value in machines, add value to total.

The share is total divided by count.
The remainder is total modulo count.
The running is 0.
The best is 0.
For each value in machines.
The extra is value minus share.
Set running to running plus extra.
The flow is the absolute value of running.
If flow is more than best, set best to flow.
If extra is more than best, set best to extra.

If remainder is not 0, set best to -1.
Show best.
